      "paper": "",
      "include": true
    },
    {
      "id": "pr-5",
      "title": "Biomedical Signal Processing and Clinical Image Analysis",
      "description": "Investigations in biomedical signal processing and medical image analysis, including motion-corrupted photoplethysmography (PPG) heart-rate estimation during intense exercise, EEG sleep and motor imagery classification, retinal blood vessel segmentation using modified U-Net architectures, and brain MRI analysis.",
